            "review_title": "Review at Nakameguro Iguchi",
            "review_text": "Ngan Tran\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nThe best Yakitori Omakase Authentic Japan in Sai Gon\nNov 2025 • Couples\nI love yakitori since I travelled Japan 2 years ago. And now, fortunately, I found Nakameguro Iguchi in Saigon with the same taste as I have tried. \nThe skewers are so good with full flavors, not too salty. It’s really juicy with my style.\nI love the “Chouchin” one which is quite unique with others. \nAnd highlight of the dining must be ramen, that was exactly taste as my memories in Japan.\nIguchi makes me miss Japan so much.\nAffordable price, minimalism space, wonderful dining are all I can say about this restaurant.\nHighly recommend for solo dining, couples or even families.\nRead more\nWritten November 30, 2025",
