            "review_text": "Nguyen M\n1 contribution\n0\nBack to Iguchi and Still Loving It 🍣\nNov 2025 • Friends\nOnce again, I came back to Iguchi, and honestly, it was just as good as every other visit! 💯\nWhat I love most is how diverse the menu is — from traditional dishes to modern twists — all still keeping that authentic, yummy flavor. 😋\n\nEvery dish came out hot, beautifully presented, and super tasty. Fresh ingredients, well-seasoned, and consistent quality every single time. The cozy space and friendly staff also make the experience even better. 🥰\n\nIguchi definitely remains one of my favorite spots to dine.\nSurely will come back again (and again)!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nYou should make reservation\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 28, 2025",
