            "review_text": "Departure00119322800\n1 contribution\n0\nYakitori\nOct 2025 • Family\nHad such a great and fun experience here!\nThe place is super clean, nicely set up, and has a classy vibe. The staff were really friendly and professional too.\nAnd the food — honestly, this was the best yakitori I’ve ever had.\nThe flavor was perfect, and the warm, smoky aroma of the freshly grilled chicken was just amazing.\nIf you love yakitori, you’ve got to check this place out!\nRead more\nWritten October 30, 2025",
