            "review_text": "masa\nShibuya, Japan244 contributions\n0\nWe don’t know the entrance… A newly created yakitori restaurant 🐓\nOct 2025 • Couples\nI went to Nakameguro Guchi, which was created in Ho Chi Minh City ✨\nAs in Japan, the grilling is the best.\nIt is savory and juicy 🐓\n\nThe atmosphere inside the restaurant is calm, and the lighting and atmosphere are just as good as in Japan.\nIt is the same as Japan that there are no signs and the entrance is a little confusing!\nIt is truly a special space like a hideaway.\n\nNaturally, the yakitori is delicious, but the specialty carbonara is alive and well, as is the gacho cabarochi.\nThe \"clay pot of ragged rice\" added at the end is also exceptional,\nIt was so complete that I was impressed from the first bite.\n\nIt went perfectly with sake 🍶\n\nThis is a rare shop where you can taste the same quality in Ho Chi Minh City as in Japan.\nIt is also recommended for dates and entertainment!\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten October 30, 2025",
